# Office temp and lock files
~$*
*.laccdb
*.ldb
.DS_Store
*.log

# This repo holds exported VBA source only. Host files can contain client data and this repo is public.
# If you really need one in the repo: git add -f <file>
*.accdb
*.accde
*.mdb
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.xlam
*.docm
*.dotm
# ...except the Excel test workbook in test/ (see test/README.md)
!test/*.xlsm
